            <div class="text-[14px] text-sand-600 italic">Hyperventilation provocation in patients with chest pain and a negative treadmill exercise test</div>
            <div class="text-[13px] text-sand-500">Journal of Psychosomatic Research, 35(1), 83-89</div>
            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-3999(91)90009-d" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-sage-300 no-underline mt-1 hover:underline">DOI: 10.1016/0022-3999(91)90009-d ↗</a>
          </div>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-sand-100 text-sand-500 whitespace-nowrap">Beperkt bewijs</span>
        </li>
        <li class="py-4 border-b border-sand-300 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-4 items-baseline">
