            <div class="text-[14px] text-sand-600 italic">Value of measuring end tidal partial pressure of carbon dioxide as an adjunct to treadmill exercise testing</div>
            <div class="text-[13px] text-sand-500">British Medical Journal, 296(6632), 1281-1285</div>
            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.296.6632.1281" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-sage-300 no-underline mt-1 hover:underline">DOI: 10.1136/bmj.296.6632.1281 ↗</a>
          </div>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-terra-50 text-terra-400 whitespace-nowrap">Matig bewijs</span>
        </li>
        <li class="py-4 border-b border-sand-300 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-4 items-baseline">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[14px] font-medium text-sand-700">Potts SG, Lewin R, Fox KA, Johnstone EC (1999)</div>
            <div class="text-[14px] text-sand-600 italic">Group psychological treatment for chest pain with normal coronary arteries</div>
            <div class="text-[13px] text-sand-500">QJM, 92(2), 81-86</div>
            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/qjmed/92.2.81" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-sage-300 no-underline mt-1 hover:underline">DOI: 10.1093/qjmed/92.2.81 ↗</a>
          </div>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-terra-50 text-terra-400 whitespace-nowrap">Matig bewijs</span>
        </li>
        <li class="py-4 border-b border-sand-300 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-4 items-baseline">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[14px] font-medium text-sand-700">Sueda S, Hashimoto H, Ochi N, et al. (2002)</div>
            <div class="text-[14px] text-sand-600 italic">New protocol to detect coronary spastic angina without fixed stenosis</div>
            <div class="text-[13px] text-sand-500">Japanese Heart Journal, 43(4), 307-317</div>
            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1536/jhj.43.307" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-sage-300 no-underline mt-1 hover:underline">DOI: 10.1536/jhj.43.307 ↗</a>
          </div>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-terra-50 text-terra-400 whitespace-nowrap">Matig bewijs</span>
        </li>
        <li class="py-4 border-b border-sand-300 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-4 items-baseline">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[14px] font-medium text-sand-700">Khanna PK, Balasubramanian KV, Dham SK, et al. (1977)</div>
            <div class="text-[14px] text-sand-600 italic">Effect of positive acceleration (+gz) on electrocardiogram of subjects with vasoregulatory abnormality</div>
            <div class="text-[13px] text-sand-500">British Heart Journal, 39(3), 317-322</div>
            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1136/hrt.39.3.317" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-sage-300 no-underline mt-1 hover:underline">DOI: 10.1136/hrt.39.3.317 ↗</a>
          </div>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-sand-100 text-sand-500 whitespace-nowrap">Beperkt bewijs</span>
        </li>
        <li class="py-4 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-4 items-baseline">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[14px] font-medium text-sand-700">van Dixhoorn J, Duivenvoorden HJ (1985)</div>
            <div class="text-[14px] text-sand-600 italic">Efficacy of Nijmegen Questionnaire in recognition of the hyperventilation syndrome</div>
            <div class="text-[13px] text-sand-500">Journal of Psychosomatic Research, 29(2), 199-206</div>
            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-3999(85)90042-x" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-sage-300 no-underline mt-1 hover:underline">DOI: 10.1016/0022-3999(85)90042-x ↗</a>
